Developer inspection commands

Usage: pudu debug [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  print-graph  Print the instance graph as JSON
  platforms    Print the per-platform pruning view as JSON
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -C <PATH>         Change to this directory before running
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v, -vv)
      --no-network  Forbid all network access
  -h, --help        Print help
